#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"Hewlett-Packard's terminfo library supports two nonstandard terminfo "
"capabilities B<meml> (memory lock) and B<memu> (memory unlock).  These will "
"be discarded with a warning message."
